{"title":"Ember Roast","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Cooking Lv 80)</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Cooking at level 80 <span class=\"muted\">(220 XP)</span> from 2× <a href=\"#/item/emberroot\">Emberroot</a>, 1× <a href=\"#/item/dragon-meat\">Dragon Meat</a>, 1× <a href=\"#/item/onion\">Onion</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div class=\"s muted\">No monster drops recorded for this item.</div>\n      \n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/cooking\">Cooking</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/emberroot\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/c829d2e658ff35331804.svg\" alt=\"\">Emberroot</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/dragon-meat\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/c652a1d404ae06dce58c.svg\" alt=\"\">Dragon Meat</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/onion\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/af6d4905906a2c85a3f4.svg\" alt=\"\">Onion</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/66b8dcce88837e80751d.svg\" alt=\"Ember Roast\"></div><h3>Ember Roast</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Cooking 80</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>—</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/24/2026, 8:22:03 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}